# A single race run to its finish (pak flow; w28r, written with script_probe --text).
# SELECT TRACK (13 s): DOWN to LAPS, LEFT x2 = 1 lap (default 3; LEFT wraps 1 -> 8); gas held from 28 s: the car finishes
# 6TH at frame 3676 (TIME 1:36.5); ENTER YOUR NAME (3742, high-score entry: A x3 picks letters, START = END); BEST LAPS
# (3901); GAME OVER menu (4200: LAP TIMES, RACE AGAIN, NEW TRACK, NEW CAR, QUIT): A on LAP TIMES shows the lap list,
# B back, DOWN + A = RACE AGAIN (the race reloads ~4560). Menu presses are 0.2 s (0.5 s auto-repeats).
# Reaches highscore_entry_anim, audio_update_d, func_800D5A04 and the end-of-race code before them.
frames 4800
pak on
4 START
7 A
10 A
13 A
15 DOWN
16 LEFT
17 LEFT
19 A
22 A
25 A
28 A 98
124 A
126 A
128 A
130 START
135 A
140 A
146 A
150 B
153 DOWN
155 A
